Z||000006||Monkeyman||10-23-2001||04:15 AM||||Is this kit stick on or are these replacement panels?  Is this real wood veneer or a synthetic?  I think I would probably go with a synthetic.  More uniform grain, a little more durable, cheaper and you can't tell the difference.  Alot of quality luxury vehicles use the synthetic (Cadillac, Lexus, even some of the M-Bs & BMWs).||||reg||1
